"**What happened**\n\n(what you saw, and what you expected)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. \n\n**Setup**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 build %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, %lu display(s)\n\n<details><summary>Diagnostics</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n" = "**起きたこと**\n\n（見たことと、期待していたこと）\n\n**手順**\n\n1. \n\n**環境**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 ビルド %@、macOS %ld.%ld.%ld、ディスプレイ %lu 台\n\n<details><summary>診断情報</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n";
